sequenceDiagram
 actor Passenger
 participant UI as TVM UI
 participant TS as Ticket Service
 participant OR as Order Repository
 participant PG as Payment Gateway Adapter
 participant GW as External Gateway / Terminal
 participant TR as Ticket Repository
 participant PR as Printer
 Passenger->>UI: Select route and payment method
 UI->>TS: Create order
 TS->>OR: Persist Pending order + idempotency key
 TS->>PG: Initiate payment
 PG->>GW: Authorize / create QR order
 GW-->>PG: Approved / declined / QR reference
 PG-->>TS: Payment result
 TS->>OR: Persist verified final status
 alt confirmed paid
 TS->>TR: Issue ticket once
 TS->>PR: Print barcode
 PR-->>UI: Print result
 UI-->>Passenger: Show ticket / recovery message
 else failed or unresolved
 UI-->>Passenger: Show failure or pending reconciliation
 end